        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Franchise: Snow White\n- Film: Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937 film)\n- People: Brothers Grimm\n- Company: Disney\n- Concepts: cel animation, German fairy tales\n\nFacts:\n- In 1937, Disney began the Snow White media franchise with the theatrical release of Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs.\n- Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs is based on a German fairy tale by the Brothers Grimm.\n- Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs was the first full-length cel animated feature film.\n- Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs was the earliest Disney animated feature film.",
